| Rules like `VAL-019 Every accepted edge has source_record_id and evidence_id`                                                                                                                         | This is excellent and should be mandatory                                                                                                 | Add `source_record_id` and `evidence_id` as required slots on every materialised edge                       | Prevents unsourced graph assertions                                                                |
