| `assertion_status`: `accepted`, `derived`, `conditional`, `pending`                                                                                                                                   | Good evidence/control concept                                                                                                             | Keep this as edge/node property or policy enum                                                              | Helps separate accepted graph facts from proposed/weak assertions                                  |
| `semantic_layer`: `ontology`, `reference`, `observation`, `derived_index`                                                                                                                             | Very useful                                                                                                                               | Keep as enum/property                                                                                       | It tells you whether edge is raw observation, reference data, or derived shortcut                  |
| `canonical_id_rule` in ontology registry                                                                                                                                                              | Very useful but not pure ontology                                                                                                         | Keep in schema documentation or `id_rules.yaml`                                                             | ID rules are implementation contract for dedup                                                     |
