| `M1`, `M2`, `Both` everywhere                                                                                                                                                                         | Good for federation, bad inside core LinkML ontology                                                                                      | Move to `pipeline_support` metadata, not core class meaning                                                 | The canonical model should survive if M1/M2 changes                                                |

