Split the output into **five files**:

| File                             | Comes from your current generated sheets                             | What goes inside                                                                            |
| -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `account_graph.linkml.yaml`      | `ontology_registry_federated` + core part of `edge_schema_federated` | Canonical classes, slots, enums, edge classes                                               |
| `edge_policy.yaml`               | `edge_schema_federated`                                              | `materialize_policy`, `cardinality`, `semantic_layer`, `assertion_status`, `evidence_class` |
| `classification_rules.yaml`      | `classification_rules_federated`                                     | Rules like prefix `SU`, `ACOE`, `ISA`, batch prefix, NHI row logic                          |
| `business_validation_rules.yaml` | `validation_rules_federated`                                         | Rules `VAL-001` to `VAL-028`                                                                |
